msgid ""
"The macros must be defined before including ``Python.h``. "
"Since :c:macro:`Py_PACK_VERSION` is not available at this point, you will "
"need to use the numeric value directly. For reference, the values for a few "
"recent Python versions are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../c-api/stable.rst:1
msgid ""
"0x30a0000  /* Py_PACK_VERSION(3.10) */\n"
"0x30b0000  /* Py_PACK_VERSION(3.11) */\n"
"0x30c0000  /* Py_PACK_VERSION(3.12) */\n"
"0x30d0000  /* Py_PACK_VERSION(3.13) */\n"
"0x30e0000  /* Py_PACK_VERSION(3.14) */\n"
"0x30f0000  /* Py_PACK_VERSION(3.15) */"
